# ---- Secrets -------------------------------------------------------------
# Strategy: secrets live in ./secrets/ (ignored) or outside the repo entirely,
# referenced by absolute path in an env var. The globs below are a safety net,
# not the plan — keep them narrow enough that they never hide a real file.
secrets/

.env
.env.*
# ...but the checked-in template is the one .env file that must be committed.
!.env.example

# Google's OAuth client + service-account downloads use predictable names.
client_secret*.json
*.apps.googleusercontent.com.json
*service-account*.json
token.json

*.pem
*.key

# ---- Python --------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/

# ---- uv / virtualenvs ----------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
# NOTE: uv.lock and .python-version are intentionally NOT ignored — commit both.

# ---- Local data ----------------------------------------------------------
*.db
*.sqlite3
media/
uploads/
media_cache/
logs/
*.log

# Scratch renders: `fb_publish.py --out` writes a PNG wherever you point it.
# Point it in here so eyeballing a card before posting never stages an artifact.
/out/

# ---- Operational state ---------------------------------------------------
# publisher.py halts on the mere existence of this file (default name; the
# PUBLISHING_KILL_SWITCH env var overrides it). It is a local, deliberately
# out-of-band lever -- committing one would halt publishing everywhere the
# repo is deployed, and it must never arrive by `git pull`.
PAUSE_PUBLISHING

# The drafting half of the same lever (app/scheduler.py), ignored for the same
# reason. Its absence here was an oversight rather than a decision: committing
# one would stop every deployment drafting, silently, on the next `git pull`.
PAUSE_DRAFTING

# ---- Tooling caches ------------------------------------------------------
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.import_linter_cache/
.grimp_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# ---- Editors / OS --------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
.claude/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
